# Pairs with NonDisclosure. Looking the grant up before authorizing tells an
# unauthorized caller "not found" where it should only learn "denied".
MODULE: AnswerLooksUpBeforeAuthorizing
TARGET: NonDisclosure
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: approve and reject report a missing grant before checking the caller's authority
PERTURBS: Answer

--- FIND
    IN IF a # "ok" THEN Refuse(verb, c, a, present, preActive, a)
       ELSE IF ~present THEN Refuse(verb, c, a, present, preActive, "notFound")
--- REPLACE
    IN IF ~present THEN Refuse(verb, c, a, present, preActive, "notFound")
       ELSE IF a # "ok" THEN Refuse(verb, c, a, present, preActive, a)
--- END